{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"halfling_burrow","model_identifier":"halfling_burrow","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# halfling_burrow\n\nHalfling burrow: a round green door and a round window in a grassy hillock, a chimney pot in the turf, and a little picket garden fence. Neutral (no team colour).\n\n- Footprint: 8 x 8 columns (128 x 128 units, 3.60 x 3.60 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -60..60, y 0..118, z -81..68 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 79, construction_0 21, construction_33 28, construction_66 39, ruined 66 (0 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- hillock: 120 x 100 x 104 centred at x 0, z 16 (front face at z -32)\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `halfling_burrow_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `halfling_burrow_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_halfling_burrow` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-10, 0, -42)\n- `fx_smoke` at (26, 119, 30)\n\n## Notes\n\n- The door keeps the 2.2 m rule (82 u) although Halflings are 1.5 m; the hillock is sized around it.\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"hill0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-60.0,0.0,-30.0],"to":[60.0,16.6667,68.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,394.3333,120.0,411.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,411.3333,98.0,428.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,394.3333,120.0,411.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,411.3333,98.0,428.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[22.0,0.0,142.0,98.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[22.0,0.0,142.0,98.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"30554b74-ca45-5f5e-aa29-23380d5dd422"},{"name":"hill1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-55.5,16.6667,-30.0],"to":[55.5,33.3333,64.1],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.5,358.6667,111.5,375.3334],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[112.0,358.6667,206.1,375.3334],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.5,358.6667,111.5,375.3334],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[112.0,358.6667,206.1,375.3334],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[142.5,0.0,253.5,94.1],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[142.5,0.0,253.5,94.1],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"c8988642-7ca2-5bdd-a12e-ad117ab7686a"},{"name":"hill2","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-51.0,33.3333,-28.2],"to":[51.0,50.0,60.2],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[121.0,394.0,223.0,410.6667],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.8,428.0,89.2,444.6667],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[121.0,394.0,223.0,410.6667],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.8,428.0,89.2,444.6667],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[1.0,128.8,